  {
   "id": "sokolnitz",
   "title": "Sokolnitz, the most contested village",
   "time": "c. 08:30-10:00",
   "narrative": "Langeron's column attacks Sokolnitz, defended by the 26th Light and Tirailleurs. Repeated assaults fail until Russian guns bombard the village and drive the garrison out. Przybyszewski's column goes for the castle, the French counterattack and take the place back, and it is lost again before Friant's division of Davout's corps retakes the village. Sokolnitz changes hands several times and soaks up the Allied left wing.",
